Correct connection for your two-leg moisture probe









Two-leg resistive soil moisture probe

The two metal legs are inserted into the soil. The probe measures electrical conductivity between them; it does not have separate VCC, GND, or AO pins.


Important: If yours is just a bare two-leg probe, don't connect the legs directly to 5V and GND continuously. That can cause corrosion and unreliable readings.

